    {
      "text": "Whisk honey and coconut cream together in a saucepan over medium-high heat; cook, stirring constantly, until mixture comes to a rolling boil. Set timer for 4 minutes and stir caramel, constantly scraping down the sides. The bubbles with be airy yet high.",
